{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ScJ58M92cW1794356502.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>瑞士運動品牌On第三季度業績好過市場預期，季內純利1.62億瑞士法郎、折合約15.4億港元，按年增長近三成七。經調整每股攤薄盈利0.54瑞士法郎，較預期多0.15瑞士法郎。</p><p></p><p>收入9.31億瑞士法郎，增長一成七。以固定匯率計，料全年度銷售增長在兩成下端，毛利率約百分之67.5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:00:19.403806+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:56.346534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:53:42.787000+00:00","content_hash":"a5ebd7849eb302a91dc832b546ce1c629d3337e4c921b14ad6599a4f352579d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:00:19.403806+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}